    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d375">

                <pb facs="0632" n="1592" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1592"/>

                <head>No. 1088.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Straus to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-06-08"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 8, 1888</date>.
                        (Received July 9.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 86.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose for your consideration a copy of
                    a <hi rendition="#italic">note verbale</hi>, with inclosure of a regulation
                    regarding joint-stock companies, received from the Sublime Porte; and likewise a
                    copy of a <hi rendition="#italic">note verbale identique</hi>, sent in reply by
                    the different foreign missions, including this legation.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">O. S. Straus.</hi></signed></closer>






